==Battleground==
*2 [[Red Slug]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Black Slug]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Angelic Slug]] spawns as the boss.
**5 [[Red Slug]]s spawn, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.
**4 [[Black Slug]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Just use any [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red cats]] ([[Swordsman Cat (Rare Cat)|Swordsman Cat]] works well) and some general units. In fact, just using meatshields and long-ranged attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Salon Cat]] will do.

